The early `return true` skips the scope comparison entirely, and `allowServiceToken` defaults to `true` (line 25), so every call site except `POST /api/devices/{serial}/decommission` (Devices.kt:108) takes it. `isServiceToken` is a `startsWith("svc-")` test on the JWT subject, and the comment on lines 12-16 says the prefix 'is what picks the right audit label rather than a trust decision on its own' — while the code makes it exactly a trust decision. Token.kt:55 sets the subject from the client-supplied `client_id`.
